  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation FINAL EVALUATION OF THE PUBLIC SERVICE TRAINING AND CAPACITY BUILDING PROGRAMME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objectives of this evaluation are to provide the relevant services of the European Union, the interested stakeholders and the wider public with:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;an overall independent assessment of the performance of the Public Service Training and Capacity Building Programme paying particular attention to its different levels of results measured against its expected objectives; and the reasons underpinning such results&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;key lessons learned, conclusions and related recommendations in order to improve future interventions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In particular, this evaluation will serve to provide lessons that can be replicated in other EU interventions and to be accountable for the use of EU resources in relation to the results of the programme.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
